    "PixaromaFreeVram": "Full hold: memory cleanup order and forced-cache semantics require generic engine work through MIKE.",
    "PixaromaLoadImagesFolder": "Full hold: arbitrary browser-approved source folders and absolute path output lack a selected guest asset API.",
    "PixaromaInpaintCrop": "Full hold: every wired-image path needs SciPy binary_fill_holes; no declared SciPy profile.",
    "PixaromaDuration": "Custom formula requires pinned simpleeval profile; recipe mode is implemented.",
    "PixaromaInpaintStitch": "Mixed-mask positive softness requires SciPy distance_transform_edt. No blur/kernel substitution.",
    "PixaromaTextOverlay": "Custom/user fonts outside bundled families refuse; bundled family rendering is tested.",
    "PixaromaTextWatermark": "Custom/user fonts outside bundled families refuse; bundled family rendering is tested.",
    "PixaromaPreview": "CivitaiMeta and execution metadata beyond exact Guest UI depth8/256KiB refuse. Source cache-token/deleted-file policy uses public storage/assets. Bounded prompt/workflow PNG metadata is exact, including global disable-metadata behavior.",
    "PixaromaSaveImage": "JPEG subsampling, WebP workflow EXIF, Civitai metadata, arbitrary host folders, counter-in-folder and cleanup-needed preview refuse by name. Normal managed PNG save cleans stale preview metadata exactly; clean-workflow preview and metadata-free WebP are qualified. UI folder is a managed logical path rather than absolute host path.",
    "PixaromaPromptReader": "Nested source-image/editor tracing and arbitrary host paths refuse. Content digest cache key replaces unavailable mtime_ns:size; bounded managed file decode/text is exact. Source missing-file notice is retained.",
    "PixaromaCrop": "Wired tensor crop is qualified. Disk/editor composite and source path branches refuse.",
    "PixaromaXYPlot": "Full named validation/execution/lifecycle refusal. Source has one process-global eight-session LRU that evicts cells and deletes grid files. Per-session KV never evicts and cannot faithfully preserve that state/cleanup contract with existing public SDK.",
    "PixaromaLoraLoader": "Catalogue, missing/zero/disabled rows, trigger resolution and row order tested with explicit recording broker operation; actual weight/model application remains Tier2. Engine owns cache retention.",
    "PixaromaImageInfo": "Bounded finite nonempty BHWC publication only; unsupported image geometry/nonfinite input refuses. Live engine object stringification in ShowText also refuses."
